appened. Myne seems ready to take his side and support him, but...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/41yMsRf0S7fDjFp7Vt9lDLp4zMj.jpg"},{"title":"La fanciulla e il drago","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":3,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15071","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"111322","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"40357","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"83095","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"353712","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"74979","synopsis":"Keel and other demi-human children in the village are starting to learn how to assume therianthrope form like Sadeena. Ren is now staying in the village while suffering the effects of the Curse swords, and doing his best to fit in.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vR4lOB162O60hXPTT8pSuybfMjr.jpg"},{"title":"La tana del drago","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":3,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15071","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"111322","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"40357","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"83095","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"353712","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"75154","synopsis":"Naofumi assembles a party to pursue Gaelion, who has consumed the Emperor Dragon's Core. Gaelion's transformation is profoundly sickening Filo, so Naofumi must return Gaelion to normal within the next two days.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/neFN4JMqFAkjnHXMhZU3mlpzwDI.jpg"},{"title":"Il Drago Demoniaco","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":3,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15071","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"111322","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"